  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "问题. 为了整修院子，先拉了5车砂子，后来又拉了$x$车。每车装3吨砂子。一共拉了多少吨砂子？",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0063#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "往院里一共拉了$5+x$车砂子。由于每车砂子是3吨，所以一共拉了$3\\cdot(5+x)$吨砂子。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0063#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "式子$3\\cdot(5+x)$含有变量$x$。这种式子叫做含变量的式子。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0063#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果在式子$3\\cdot(5+x)$里，用7代替$x$，就得到数式$3\\cdot(5+7)$，它的值是36。如果用9代替$x$，就得到数式$3\\cdot(5+9)$，它的值是42。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0063#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果$x=7$，那么$3\\cdot(5+x)=36$；如果$x=9$，那么$3\\cdot(5+x)=42$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0063#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "为了解题，也可以列出另一式子：$3\\cdot5+3\\cdot x$。$x$取任意值时它与式子$3\\cdot(5+x)$的值都相同。写成：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0063#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "当$x$为任意值时，$3\\cdot(5+x)=3\\cdot5+3\\cdot x$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0063#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "下表中列有这两个式子的一些值：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 54,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0063#11"
      ]
    },
